1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
This is the Wall of blacktongue.

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,160
Its signature Cent,

3
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:08,640
number 5185, was struck in 1968,

4
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:12,400
carries a full desert patina, and is a Ghost Cent.

5
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,120
The Wall holds twenty-four Cents,

6
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,680
from 1938 to 1980,

7
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:19,440
which puts it in the Dime Club,

8
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,480
for ten to twenty-four Cents.

9
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:25,520
Among them is one of only two Cents from 1938.

10
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:27,840
It is one of two wheat pennies on the Wall,

11
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:30,160
with a Cent from 1958.

12
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:32,560
The Wall also holds one of nine Cents

13
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,560
with a full gold patina.

14
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,880
That gold, with five other Cents,

15
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:39,200
completes a Full Spectrum Set:

16
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:41,760
a full verdigris, a full obsidian,

17
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:44,000
a full red, a full desert,

18
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:46,200
a full gold and an orange.

19
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:49,040
Only nine Full Spectrum Sets can exist,

20
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,640
as there are only nine Full Gold Cents.

21
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:55,200
As of October 2026, blacktongue is the only

22
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,720
collector to hold one of these

23
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,840
rare Full Spectrum Sets.

24
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:01,440
Across its Cents, the Wall also covers

25
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:04,000
four of the twelve contamination types,

26
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:05,960
which makes a Contamination Set.

27
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:08,160
Two of its Cents are Ghost Cents,

28
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:09,960
and one is Vandalized.

29
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:12,800
And the Wall carries Diamond Hands:

30
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,560
it has held its position for at least

31
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:16,720
a year, with little to no selling.

32
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:18,640
Find all of the Collector Walls

33
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:21,360
on cents.vision under Collectors.
